WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.637
Seu aplicativo pode nascer pronto.

00:00:02.657 --> 00:00:05.957
O Rendra App traz 68 componentes em

00:00:05.977 --> 00:00:08.767
React Native, com a navegação completa:

00:00:08.787 --> 00:00:11.147
cabeçalho, barra inferior e menu.

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:13.144
Três modelos e quatro paletas,

00:00:13.164 --> 00:00:14.583
no claro e no escuro.

00:00:14.603 --> 00:00:16.372
Telas de exemplo que funcionam:

00:00:16.392 --> 00:00:19.704
painel, atendimento, agenda e funil comercial.

00:00:19.724 --> 00:00:22.966
Feito com Expo, Expo Router e NativeWind,

00:00:22.986 --> 00:00:25.648
com toque mínimo de 44 pixels.

00:00:25.668 --> 00:00:26.658
Rendra App.

00:00:26.678 --> 00:00:30.497
Código aberto, sob licença MIT.
